    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>We want you to be confident in your purchase of the DIY Credit Report &amp; Credit Building Guide. This Refund Policy explains the terms under which refunds may be issued.</p>

    <h2>7-Day Refund Window</h2>
    <p>We offer a 7-day refund policy from the date of purchase. If within 7 days you believe the guide does not match its description, you may request a refund.</p>

    <h2>Eligibility for Refund</h2>
    <p>Refund requests are reviewed on a case-by-case basis. The following factors are considered:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The reason for the refund request</li>
      <li>Whether the guide was downloaded</li>
      <li>The time elapsed since purchase</li>
      <li>Any technical issues encountered</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to Request a Refund</h2>
    <p>To request a refund, please contact our support team with the following information:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The email address used for the purchase</li>
      <li>The approximate date of purchase</li>
      <li>A brief explanation of why you're requesting a refund</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can submit a refund request through our <a href="/support">Support page</a>. Please select "Refund Request" as the subject.</p>

    <h2>Processing Time</h2>
    <p>Refund requests are reviewed within 2-3 business days. If approved, refunds will be processed to the original payment method within 5-10 business days, depending on your financial institution.</p>

    <h2>Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
    <p>Refunds may be denied in the following circumstances:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Requests made more than 7 days after purchase</li>
      <li>The guide was downloaded and no technical issues were reported</li>
      <li>The request is based on unmet expectations that contradict the guide's stated educational purpose</li>
      <li>Fraudulent or abusive refund requests</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Educational Purpose Acknowledgment</h2>
    <p>By purchasing the guide, you acknowledge that this is an educational resource — not a credit repair service. We do not guarantee specific results, credit score improvements, or dispute outcomes. Refunds will not be issued solely because you did not achieve desired credit results.</p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Refund Policy, please <a href="/support">contact our support team</a>.</p>
